  <a href="./">← Kerfline</a>
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p>Last updated 16 October 2026.</p>

  <h2>The short version</h2>
  <p>Kerfline collects nothing about you. There are no accounts, no sign-in, no ads, no analytics, no cookies and no tracking.</p>

  <h2>Your drawings</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Drawings are saved in your own browser's storage on your device. They are never uploaded.</li>
    <li>If you run the optional folder server from the downloaded app, drawings are also saved as files in a folder on your own computer.</li>
    <li>Files you export (SVG, PDF, DXF, PNG) are created on your device.</li>
    <li>To delete everything, delete your drawings in Kerfline, or clear this site's data in your browser settings.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Hosting</h2>
  <p>This website is served by Surge (surge.sh), a static web host. Like any web server, it may keep standard technical logs, such as IP addresses and the pages requested, to run and protect the service. SRIVELTECH does not receive or use these logs. Fonts and all app code are part of the page; nothing is loaded from other websites.</p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>Kerfline is made for learners of all ages. Because it collects no personal information, there is nothing for a child to share.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>If this ever changes, this page will say so first, with a new date.</p>

  <footer>Created by SRIVELTECH · © 2026 SRIVELTECH</footer>
</main>
